---
description: State-aware dynamic content rules
alwaysApply: false
---
Support common states: carousels/sliders, tabs, accordions, modals, dropdowns and show/hide.
- Model content as page -> state -> content item.
- Never overwrite one state with another.
- Deduplicate equivalent states.
- Put limits on browser discovery.
- Do not clone complex backend application logic in MVP.
- Report unsupported dynamic behavior clearly.
- Keep browser automation isolated and security constrained.
- Test edits are scoped to the correct state.
